3
00:00:14,390 --> 00:00:20,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">hikarabita kotoba wo tsunai de</font></font></b></font></font>

4
00:00:14,390 --> 00:00:20,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">connecting old words that have<font color="#ffffff"> been used up</font></font></font></b></font></font>

5
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:28,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">soredemo bokura shinpuru na omoi wo tsutaetai dake na no</font></font></b></font></font>

6
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:28,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">I just want to convey my simple thoughts</font></font></b></font></font>

7
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">fukinukeru kusunda ano hi no kaze wa</font></font></b></font></font>

8
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that day's faint wind blows away</font></font></b></font></font>

9
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kinou no haikyo ni uchi sutete</font></font></b></font></font>

10
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">at the castle ruins of yesterday</font></font></b></font></font>

11
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kimi to warau ima wo ikiru no da</font></font></b></font></font>

12
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">I'll laugh with you and live for the moment</font></font></b></font></font>

13
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">soredemo ano dekigoto ga kimi wo kurushimeru daro</font></font></b></font></font>

14
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">still that incident will continue to trouble you, right?</font></font></b></font></font>

15
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">dakarakoso sayonara nanda</font></font></b></font></font>

16
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that's why it must be good-bye</font></font></b></font></font>

17
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">konomama nanimo nokorazu ni anata to wakachiau dake</font></font></b></font></font>

18
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">leaving nothing behind, let us share what is left</font></font></b></font></font>

19
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yagate bokura wa sore ga subetee dato kigatsuite</font></font></b></font></font>

20
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">in time, we'll realize that it was everything</font></font></b></font></font>

21
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kanashimi wa hoo wo tsutatte namida no kawa ni naru dake</font></font></b></font></font>

22
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">and sadness will touch our cheeks, creating a river of tears</font></font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yureru omoi wa tsuyoi uzu ni n<font color="#ffffff">atte tokeau no yo</font></font></font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">Trembling thoughts swept into a vortex and melting away</font></font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:31,150 --> 00:01:33,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire Style: Fire Ball Jutsu!</font>

26
00:01:39,870 --> 00:01:41,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What is that Jutsu?!</font>

27
00:01:47,170 --> 00:01:48,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

28
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:51,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chidori!</font>

29
00:01:54,460 --> 00:01:55,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll win no matter what!</font>

30
00:01:55,970 --> 00:01:57,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't flatter yourself!</font>

31
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:02,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it!</font>

32
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:12,270
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Invisible Crack</font>

33
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:28,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a tranquil village as always...</font>

34
00:02:28,750 --> 00:02:30,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The security sucks.</font>

35
00:02:30,920 --> 00:02:31,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph!</font>

36
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:37,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We should just massacre everybody
in such a seedy village.</font>

37
00:02:37,420 --> 00:02:39,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down, Sakon.</font>

38
00:02:39,470 --> 00:02:41,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We haven't come here to fight.</font>

39
00:02:41,890 --> 00:02:43,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up you chicken.</font>

40
00:02:44,060 --> 00:02:45,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're scared</font>

41
00:02:45,260 --> 00:02:47,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you should just go home
and go to bed already.</font>

42
00:02:47,180 --> 00:02:49,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm telling you to calm down, Tayuya.</font>

43
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:53,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You understand what
our job is this time, right?</font>

44
00:02:53,820 --> 00:02:56,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go.
We escort our special guest.</font>

45
00:03:04,950 --> 00:03:07,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it!</font>

46
00:03:10,750 --> 00:03:11,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn.</font>

47
00:03:11,830 --> 00:03:13,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't stop completely.</font>

48
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:27,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei?</font>

49
00:03:29,390 --> 00:03:31,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto... That thing you just did was...</font>

50
00:03:40,150 --> 00:03:42,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you guys doing
up on top of the hospital?</font>

51
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:46,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You went a bit too far
for just a fight you two.</font>

52
00:03:56,460 --> 00:03:58,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Jutsu earlier... no doubt...</font>

53
00:03:59,460 --> 00:04:01,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was the Rasengan.</font>

54
00:04:06,430 --> 00:04:07,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on?</font>

55
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:10,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How can Naruto use that Jutsu...?</font>

56
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:26,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Were you going to kill Naruto, Sasuke?</font>

57
00:04:28,950 --> 00:04:31,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing giving yourself over
to a sense of superiority?</font>

58
00:04:35,170 --> 00:04:37,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The size of the Chidori there
wasn't one to be aimed</font>

59
00:04:37,960 --> 00:04:40,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">at a comrade of the same village.</font>

60
00:04:46,010 --> 00:04:48,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why such infantile behavior...?</font>

61
00:04:50,180 --> 00:04:52,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure enough a reunion with Itachi...</font>

62
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:08,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun.</font>

63
00:05:26,880 --> 00:05:27,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

64
00:05:32,140 --> 00:05:33,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

65
00:05:33,850 --> 00:05:35,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How far will you go...?</font>

66
00:06:28,780 --> 00:06:30,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei...</font>

67
00:06:38,540 --> 00:06:40,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whatever happened to teamwork?</font>

68
00:06:42,130 --> 00:06:45,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was it you...
who taught him that technique?</font>

69
00:06:46,510 --> 00:06:51,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think Naruto is still too young
to be handling that Jutsu.</font>

70
00:06:55,180 --> 00:06:57,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He could've killed Sasuke
had something gone wrong...</font>

71
00:06:59,140 --> 00:07:02,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if it's a means of resisting
the Akatsuki</font>

72
00:07:02,310 --> 00:07:04,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to think you would teach Naruto
that Jutsu...</font>

73
00:07:05,650 --> 00:07:07,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right back at you...</font>

74
00:07:08,690 --> 00:07:11,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Chidori was also considerably hairy.</font>

75
00:07:11,910 --> 00:07:14,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I didn't think he was
the kind of kid</font>

76
00:07:14,580 --> 00:07:18,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who'd fire that Jutsu at his comrade.</font>

77
00:07:19,750 --> 00:07:23,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or is it that there's something quite
complicated between him and that kid?</font>

78
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:27,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well all sorts.</font>

79
00:07:27,760 --> 00:07:28,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All sorts?</font>

80
00:07:29,470 --> 00:07:31,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Quite simply it's a relationship</font>

81
00:07:31,760 --> 00:07:34,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">like the one between you
and Orochimaru in the past.</font>

82
00:07:38,390 --> 00:07:39,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

83
00:07:40,980 --> 00:07:44,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To him, Sasuke is a comrade
and a rival at the same time...</font>

84
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:49,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, someone he considers
an equal.</font>

85
00:07:50,610 --> 00:07:54,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Most likely he couldn't take
Sasuke's cheap provocation.</font>

86
00:07:55,450 --> 00:07:58,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's been chasing him...</font>

87
00:07:59,330 --> 00:08:01,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chasing him since the Academy days.</font>

88
00:08:01,790 --> 00:08:03,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you hurt...</font>

89
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:06,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Scaredy Cat?</font>

90
00:08:10,090 --> 00:08:11,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

91
00:08:16,510 --> 00:08:18,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't lose to you!</font>

92
00:08:20,180 --> 00:08:23,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For him it's neither you
nor me now...</font>

93
00:08:24,190 --> 00:08:25,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More than anyone...</font>

94
00:08:25,980 --> 00:08:29,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he wants to be recognized by Sasuke.</font>

95
00:08:31,940 --> 00:08:33,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On the other side of the coin...</font>

96
00:08:33,610 --> 00:08:38,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke feels the speed of Naruto's growth
at close range and feels inferior.</font>

97
00:08:38,620 --> 00:08:43,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To the extent that he thinks
he himself isn't growing at all.</font>

98
00:08:43,870 --> 00:08:45,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Scaredy Cat?</font>

99
00:08:45,290 --> 00:08:47,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Multi-Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

100
00:08:48,090 --> 00:08:49,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning Jutsu!</font>

101
00:08:55,720 --> 00:08:58,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto has gotten strong...</font>

102
00:08:59,060 --> 00:09:00,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And Sasuke...</font>

103
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:05,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to kill a certain man
no matter what.</font>

104
00:09:06,850 --> 00:09:08,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Revenge, huh...?</font>

105
00:09:09,230 --> 00:09:12,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if Itachi
is frustrating that kid.</font>

106
00:09:13,780 --> 00:09:16,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So Sasuke doesn't want
to acknowledge Naruto.</font>

107
00:09:16,700 --> 00:09:18,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he acknowledges him</font>

108
00:09:18,490 --> 00:09:21,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he just might deny himself
up to this point...</font>

109
00:09:22,540 --> 00:09:25,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rivalry is a difficult thing.</font>

110
00:09:26,460 --> 00:09:28,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not a very good trend...</font>

111
00:09:29,750 --> 00:09:32,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Maybe I'll do some scolding.</font>

112
00:09:32,630 --> 00:09:34,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I leave Naruto to you.</font>

113
00:09:35,300 --> 00:09:38,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I have a mission.
And there's the Chidori thing too...</font>

114
00:09:42,430 --> 00:09:43,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura.</font>

115
00:09:44,640 --> 00:09:48,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay. Things can go back to the way
they were in the old days again.</font>

116
00:09:49,690 --> 00:09:50,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cheer up.</font>

117
00:09:52,150 --> 00:09:53,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See ya.</font>

118
00:10:01,620 --> 00:10:03,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks Kakashi-sensei.</font>

119
00:10:07,710 --> 00:10:08,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

120
00:10:10,330 --> 00:10:11,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan.</font>

121
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:17,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't interfere with us!</font>

122
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:49,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are weak.</font>

123
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:51,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you weak?</font>

124
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:55,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's because you don't have enough...</font>

125
00:10:55,250 --> 00:10:56,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...hate.</font>

126
00:10:57,920 --> 00:10:59,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What've I been doing...</font>

127
00:11:01,510 --> 00:11:03,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">up until now?</font>

128
00:11:15,190 --> 00:11:16,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He got a nice look in those eyes.</font>

129
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:33,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shall we go soon?</font>

130
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:40,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you think you're doing?</font>

131
00:12:41,110 --> 00:12:44,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I don't do this
you'll run away right?</font>

132
00:12:44,110 --> 00:12:47,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not the type
to listen quietly to lectures.</font>

133
00:12:49,830 --> 00:12:52,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As I recall,
that's Kakashi the Copy Ninja.</font>

134
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:59,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke... Forget about something
like revenge.</font>

135
00:12:59,800 --> 00:13:00,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

136
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:06,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, in this business
I've seen a stink of guys like you.</font>

137
00:13:07,300 --> 00:13:10,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the final days of those who speak
of revenge are never good.</font>

138
00:13:12,220 --> 00:13:13,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're tragic.</font>

139
00:13:16,980 --> 00:13:21,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll only hurt yourself and
agonize more than now.</font>

140
00:13:21,980 --> 00:13:26,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you succeed in revenge
all that will remain is emptiness.</font>

141
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:27,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

142
00:13:27,570 --> 00:13:29,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you know?</font>

143
00:13:29,450 --> 00:13:32,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't talk to me as if you know!</font>

144
00:13:32,450 --> 00:13:34,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well calm down...</font>

145
00:13:35,370 --> 00:13:36,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you like</font>

146
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:40,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">shall I go and kill the person
most important to you?</font>

147
00:13:40,710 --> 00:13:43,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll be able to realize just
how far off you are</font>

148
00:13:43,670 --> 00:13:45,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">on what you just said.</font>

149
00:13:45,470 --> 00:13:48,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I wouldn't mind if you'd do that.</font>

150
00:13:49,050 --> 00:13:52,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unfortunately, I don't even have
one person like that.</font>

151
00:13:54,520 --> 00:13:57,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone's already been killed.</font>

152
00:14:00,020 --> 00:14:02,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've lived longer than you have...</font>

153
00:14:02,980 --> 00:14:04,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The times were not good.</font>

154
00:14:05,530 --> 00:14:09,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know all too well
the agony of losing something.</font>

155
00:14:13,080 --> 00:14:16,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, both you and I
aren't the lucky ones...</font>

156
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:18,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's for damned sure.</font>

157
00:14:19,580 --> 00:14:21,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But we're not the worst either.</font>

158
00:14:23,210 --> 00:14:24,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You and I,</font>

159
00:14:24,920 --> 00:14:27,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we both have already found
dear comrades, haven't we?</font>

160
00:14:34,680 --> 00:14:36,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's because I have lost
that I understand.</font>

161
00:14:37,810 --> 00:14:39,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Chidori is a power...</font>

162
00:14:39,270 --> 00:14:42,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I gave to you because
you now have something important.</font>

163
00:14:44,110 --> 00:14:45,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should know that
it's not a power</font>

164
00:14:46,070 --> 00:14:48,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to be used on your comrade
or to use for revenge</font>

165
00:14:48,700 --> 00:14:52,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and I'm sure you know
what it should be used for.</font>

166
00:14:53,280 --> 00:14:58,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Think hard about whether or not
what I'm saying is wrong.</font>

167
00:15:09,050 --> 00:15:12,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll be tricky with a Shinobi
of that level hanging around.</font>

168
00:15:13,350 --> 00:15:14,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So let's wait a bit.</font>

169
00:15:15,180 --> 00:15:20,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Maybe jerks like you'd be no good.
But I could do it.</font>

170
00:15:20,190 --> 00:15:24,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder. "Two"
should be ample to rip him apart.</font>

171
00:15:25,360 --> 00:15:28,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be butting in all the time,
you idiot.</font>

172
00:15:29,820 --> 00:15:32,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tayuya, women shouldn't
use words like that too...</font>

173
00:15:32,870 --> 00:15:34,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up, fatso.</font>

174
00:16:44,980 --> 00:16:46,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— More please!
— More please!</font>

175
00:16:55,530 --> 00:16:56,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wanna head back?</font>

176
00:16:56,820 --> 00:16:57,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure!</font>

177
00:16:59,410 --> 00:17:02,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We both made it
to the top of the tree.</font>

178
00:17:23,980 --> 00:17:24,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan.</font>

179
00:17:26,020 --> 00:17:27,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have something to talk
to you about.</font>

180
00:17:28,270 --> 00:17:30,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll go out on a date with you
so come along.</font>

181
00:17:52,380 --> 00:17:53,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it...</font>

182
00:17:56,880 --> 00:17:58,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

183
00:18:26,790 --> 00:18:30,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Curse Mark left by Orochimaru
during the Chunin Exam...</font>

184
00:18:39,380 --> 00:18:42,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei said
it was okay now but...</font>

185
00:18:59,360 --> 00:19:00,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama.</font>

186
00:19:01,320 --> 00:19:04,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You didn't need to send out
all four members, did you?</font>

187
00:19:05,950 --> 00:19:11,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems those kids are all interested
in Sasuke-kun to whom I've taken a liking.</font>

188
00:19:12,380 --> 00:19:14,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To see what extent his power is...</font>

189
00:19:15,130 --> 00:19:17,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A contest of strength or whatever</font>

190
00:19:17,170 --> 00:19:20,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">at this point Sasuke-kun would be
no match for them.</font>

191
00:19:24,680 --> 00:19:29,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is precisely why... he will come to me
in search of power.</font>

192
00:19:36,820 --> 00:19:38,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who're you guys?</font>

193
00:19:39,490 --> 00:19:43,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Kidomaru, the East Gate
of the Sound Ninja Four.</font>

194
00:19:44,160 --> 00:19:46,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Sakon,
the West Gate of the same.</font>

195
00:19:46,700 --> 00:19:49,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Jirobo,
the South Gate of the same.</font>

196
00:19:49,790 --> 00:19:51,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Tayuya,
the North Gate of the same.</font>

197
00:20:54,480 --> 00:20:56,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm in a bad mood now...</font>

198
00:20:57,730 --> 00:20:59,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you wanna continue to fight here</font>

