235
00:22:39,420 --> 00:22:40,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What do you want to eat, Sakura-chan?</font>

236
00:22:40,920 --> 00:22:41,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Anything's fine.</font>

237
00:22:42,000 --> 00:22:44,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">At any rate
